---
import Legal from '../../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { empresa } from '../../data/empresa';

const actualizado = '13 September 2026';
---

<Legal
  locale="en"
  pagina="privacidad"
  titulo="Privacy policy"
  descripcion="How Terra Compostaje handles the personal data of people who visit this site and contact us, under Argentina's Personal Data Protection Act 25.326."
  actualizado={actualizado}
  etiquetaActualizado="Last updated:"
>
  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>
    This site is operated by <strong>{empresa.razonSocial}</strong>, trading as
    {' '}<strong>{empresa.nombre}</strong>, with registered offices at {empresa.direccion},
    {' '}{empresa.ciudad}, {empresa.provincia}, Argentina.
  </p>
  <p>
    For any question about this policy, write to
    {' '}<a href={`mailto:${empresa.email}`}>{empresa.email}</a> or call
    {' '}{empresa.telefonoInternacional}.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <h3>Data you give us</h3>
  <p>
    When you email us, message us on WhatsApp or fill in a form, we receive whatever you
    choose to include: typically your name, the company you represent, an email address, a
    phone number and the details of your enquiry.
  </p>
  <h3>Browsing data</h3>
  <p>
    Like any website, we record technical data about your visit: IP address, device and
    browser type, pages viewed and where you came from. We use it in aggregate to understand
    which content is useful.
  </p>

  <h2>What we use it for</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Answering your enquiries and preparing commercial proposals.</li>
    <li>Delivering the services you contract, and issuing certificates and reports.</li>
    <li>Meeting our legal, tax and environmental obligations.</li>
    <li>Improving the site and understanding how it is used.</li>
    <li>
      Sending you news about our services, only if you have consented. You can withdraw that
      consent at any time.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p><strong>We do not sell or transfer your personal data to third parties</strong> for commercial purposes.</p>

  <h2>Cookies and measurement</h2>
  <p>
    We use first-party cookies that are necessary for the site to work and to remember your
    preferences. These do not require consent.
  </p>
  <p>
    We may also use third-party cookies to measure audience and advertising, such as Google
    Analytics and the Meta pixel. <strong>These are only activated if you accept them</strong>
    {' '}in the cookie notice. Until you do, those tags are not loaded. You can change your
    choice at any time from that notice, or by clearing your browser cookies.
  </p>

  <h2>Who we share data with</h2>
  <p>
    Only with the providers we need in order to operate — site hosting, email, measurement
    tools — and with public authorities where the law requires it. Some of these providers
    process information on servers outside Argentina; by using the site and contacting us,
    you accept that transfer.
  </p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>
    We keep data for as long as the original purpose requires and then for the periods
    required by applicable commercial, tax and environmental rules. After that we delete or
    anonymise it.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask us at any time to access your personal data, correct it if it is wrong,
    update it or delete it. Write to
    {' '}<a href={`mailto:${empresa.email}`}>{empresa.email}</a> telling us what you need.
  </p>

  <div class="destacado">
    <p>
      Under Argentine law, the data subject may exercise the right of access free of charge
      at intervals of no less than six months, unless a legitimate interest is demonstrated,
      as set out in section 14(3) of Act No. 25.326.
    </p>
    <p>
      The <strong>Agencia de Acceso a la Información Pública</strong>, as the supervisory
      authority for Act No. 25.326, is empowered to handle complaints and claims regarding
      failures to comply with personal data protection rules.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>
    This site is aimed at companies, institutions and adults. We do not knowingly collect
    data from anyone under 18.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    If we change it, we will publish the new version on this page and update the date in the
    heading.
  </p>
</Legal>
